#. type: Title #
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Qiskit Code Assistant {#qiskit-code-assistant}"
msgstr "Qiskit Code Assistant {#qiskit-code-assistant}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Qiskit Code Assistant LLMs aim to make quantum computing more accessible to "
"new Qiskit adopters and to improve the coding experience for current users. "
"It is trained using millions of text tokens from Qiskit SDK, years of Qiskit"
" code examples, and IBM Quantum&reg; features. Qiskit Code Assistant can "
"help your quantum development workflow by offering LLM-generated suggestions"
" based on [IBM Granite and other open-source "
"models](https://huggingface.co/Qiskit), which incorporate the latest "
"features and functionalities from IBM&reg;.\n"
msgstr ""
"Los LLMs de Qiskit Code Assistant tienen como objetivo hacer la computación "
"cuántica más accesible para los nuevos usuarios de Qiskit y mejorar la "
"experiencia de programación para los usuarios actuales. Ha sido entrenado "
"con millones de tokens de texto del SDK de Qiskit, años de ejemplos de "
"código Qiskit y características de IBM Quantum&reg;. Qiskit Code Assistant "
"puede ayudar en tu flujo de trabajo de desarrollo cuántico ofreciendo "
"sugerencias generadas por LLM basadas en [modelos IBM Granite y otros "
"modelos de código abierto](https://huggingface.co/Qiskit), que incorporan "
"las últimas características y funcionalidades de IBM&reg;.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\" title=\"Notes\">\n"
"- **Want to skip to the installation instructions? Go to the [Install Qiskit Code Assistant](#install) section.**\n"
"- If you have feedback or want to contact the developer team, use the [Qiskit Slack Workspace channel](https://qiskit.enterprise.slack.com/archives/C07LYA6PL83) or the related public GitHub repositories.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\" title=\"Notas\">\n"
"- **¿Quieres ir directamente a las instrucciones de instalación? Ve a la sección [Instalar Qiskit Code Assistant](#install).**\n"
"- Si tienes comentarios o deseas contactar con el equipo de desarrollo, usa el [canal de Qiskit en Slack Workspace](https://qiskit.enterprise.slack.com/archives/C07LYA6PL83) o los repositorios públicos de GitHub relacionados.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The Large Language Model (LLM) behind Qiskit Code Assistant {#the-large-"
"language-model-llm-behind-qiskit-code-assistant}"
msgstr ""
"El modelo de lenguaje grande (LLM) detrás de Qiskit Code Assistant {#the-"
"large-language-model-llm-behind-qiskit-code-assistant}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"To provide code suggestions, Qiskit Code Assistant uses a Large Language "
"Model (LLM). In this case, Qiskit Code Assistant currently relies on the "
"model `mistral-small-3.2-24b-qiskit`, built on the [Mistral-"
"Small-3.2-24B-Qiskit model](https://huggingface.co/Qiskit/mistral-"
"small-3.2-24b-qiskit). The `mistral-small-3.2-24b-qiskit` model improves the"
" `Mistral-Small-3.2-24B-Instruct-2506` model's code generation capabilities "
"for Qiskit through extended pretraining and fine-tuning it on high-quality "
"Qiskit data, as well as Python commits and chat. For more information about "
"the Mistral AI models family, refer to [Mistral AI "
"documentation](https://docs.mistral.ai/getting-started/models). For more "
"details about the `.*-qiskit` models, see [Qiskit Code Assistant: Training "
"LLMs for generating Quantum Computing "
"Code](https://arxiv.org/abs/2405.19495).\n"
msgstr ""
"Para proporcionar sugerencias de código, Qiskit Code Assistant utiliza un "
"modelo de lenguaje grande (LLM). En este caso, Qiskit Code Assistant "
"actualmente se apoya en el modelo `mistral-small-3.2-24b-qiskit`, construido"
" sobre el [modelo Mistral-"
"Small-3.2-24B-Qiskit](https://huggingface.co/Qiskit/mistral-"
"small-3.2-24b-qiskit). El modelo `mistral-small-3.2-24b-qiskit` mejora las "
"capacidades de generación de código para Qiskit del modelo `Mistral-"
"Small-3.2-24B-Instruct-2506` mediante preentrenamiento extendido y ajuste "
"fino con datos de Qiskit de alta calidad, así como confirmaciones de Python "
"y chat. Para más información sobre la familia de modelos Mistral AI, "
"consulta la [documentación de Mistral AI](https://docs.mistral.ai/getting-"
"started/models). Para más detalles sobre los modelos `.*-qiskit`, consulta "
"[Qiskit Code Assistant: Training LLMs for generating Quantum Computing "
"Code](https://arxiv.org/abs/2405.19495).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Our LLMs specialized for Qiskit are available also as open-source models. "
"Check all the models available at https://huggingface.co/Qiskit.\n"
msgstr ""
"Nuestros LLMs especializados para Qiskit también están disponibles como "
"modelos de código abierto. Consulta todos los modelos disponibles en "
"https://huggingface.co/Qiskit.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The Qiskit HumanEval and Qiskit HumanEval Hard benchmarks {#the-qiskit-"
"humaneval-and-qiskit-humaneval-hard-benchmarks}"
msgstr ""
"Los benchmarks Qiskit HumanEval y Qiskit HumanEval Hard {#the-qiskit-"
"humaneval-and-qiskit-humaneval-hard-benchmarks}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"To test the `mistral-small-3.2-24b-qiskit` and other models, we collaborated"
" with Qiskit Advocates and experts to create the execution-based benchmarks "
"called Qiskit HumanEval (QHE) and Qiskit HumanEval Hard (QHE Hard), and ran "
"them on the models. These benchmarks are similar to "
"[HumanEval](https://arxiv.org/abs/2107.03374), including multiple "
"challenging code problems to solve, all based on the official Qiskit "
"libraries.\n"
msgstr ""
"Para probar `mistral-small-3.2-24b-qiskit` y otros modelos, colaboramos con "
"Qiskit Advocates y expertos para crear los benchmarks basados en ejecución "
"llamados Qiskit HumanEval (QHE) y Qiskit HumanEval Hard (QHE Hard), y los "
"ejecutamos sobre los modelos. Estos benchmarks son similares a "
"[HumanEval](https://arxiv.org/abs/2107.03374), e incluyen múltiples "
"problemas de código desafiantes a resolver, todos basados en las bibliotecas"
" oficiales de Qiskit.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The benchmarks are composed of approximately 150 tests, each one made from a"
" function definition, followed by a docstring that details the task the "
"model is required to solve. Each example also includes a reference canonical"
" solution, as well as unit tests, to evaluate the correctness of the "
"generated solutions. There are three levels of difficulty for tests: basic, "
"intermediate, and difficult. The Qiskit HumanEval Hard benchmark is a "
"variation of the Qiskit HumanEval one, but removes information related to "
"code imports, so the LLM needs to figure out the right method or class "
"imports. This change makes the dataset much more challenging for LLMs, "
"according to our tests and initial results.\n"
msgstr ""
"Los benchmarks están compuestos por aproximadamente 150 pruebas, cada una "
"elaborada a partir de una definición de función seguida de un docstring que "
"detalla la tarea que el modelo debe resolver. Cada ejemplo también incluye "
"una solución canónica de referencia, así como pruebas unitarias para evaluar"
" la corrección de las soluciones generadas. Hay tres niveles de dificultad "
"para las pruebas: básico, intermedio y difícil. El benchmark Qiskit "
"HumanEval Hard es una variación del Qiskit HumanEval, pero elimina la "
"información relacionada con las importaciones de código, por lo que el LLM "
"debe determinar las importaciones correctas de métodos o clases. Este cambio"
" hace que el dataset sea mucho más desafiante para los LLMs, según nuestras "
"pruebas y resultados iniciales.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The datasets for Qiskit HumanEval and Qiskit HumanEval Hard are available at"
" these websites: [Qiskit "
"HumanEval](https://huggingface.co/datasets/Qiskit/qiskit_humaneval) and "
"[Qiskit "
"HumanEval](https://huggingface.co/datasets/Qiskit/qiskit_humaneval_hard). "
"You can contribute to the development of these benchmarks at the [GitHub "
"repository](https://github.com/qiskit-community/qiskit-human-eval).\n"
msgstr ""
"Los datasets de Qiskit HumanEval y Qiskit HumanEval Hard están disponibles "
"en estos sitios web: [Qiskit "
"HumanEval](https://huggingface.co/datasets/Qiskit/qiskit_humaneval) y "
"[Qiskit "
"HumanEval](https://huggingface.co/datasets/Qiskit/qiskit_humaneval_hard). "
"Puedes contribuir al desarrollo de estos benchmarks en el [repositorio de "
"GitHub.](https://github.com/qiskit-community/qiskit-human-eval)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"install\"></span>\n"
msgstr "<span id=\"install\"></span>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Install Qiskit Code Assistant {#install-qiskit-code-assistant}"
msgstr "Instalar Qiskit Code Assistant {#install-qiskit-code-assistant}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Learn how to install, configure, and use any of Qiskit Code Assistant models"
" on your local machine.\n"
msgstr ""
"Aprende cómo instalar, configurar y usar cualquiera de los modelos de Qiskit"
" Code Assistant en tu máquina local.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Accordion>\n"
"<AccordionItem title=\"Download from the Hugging Face website\">\n"
msgstr ""
"<Accordion>\n"
"<AccordionItem title=\"Descargar desde el sitio web de Hugging Face\">\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Follow these steps to download any Qiskit Code Assistant-related model from "
"the Hugging Face website:\n"
msgstr ""
"Sigue estos pasos para descargar cualquier modelo relacionado con Qiskit "
"Code Assistant desde el sitio web de Hugging Face:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Navigate to the desired Qiskit model page on Hugging Face.\n"
msgstr "Navega a la página del modelo de Qiskit deseado en Hugging Face.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '2. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Go to the **Files and Versions** tab and download the safetensors or GGUF "
"model files.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ve a la pestaña **Files and Versions** y descarga los archivos del modelo en"
" formato safetensors o GGUF.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "</AccordionItem>\n"
msgstr "</AccordionItem>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "<AccordionItem title=\"Download using the Hugging Face CLI\">\n"
msgstr "<AccordionItem title=\"Descargar usando la CLI de Hugging Face\">\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"To download any of the available Qiskit Code Assistant models using the "
"Hugging Face CLI, follow these steps:\n"
msgstr ""
"Para descargar cualquiera de los modelos disponibles de Qiskit Code "
"Assistant usando la CLI de Hugging Face, sigue estos pasos:\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Install the [Hugging Face "
"CLI](https://huggingface.co/docs/huggingface_hub/main/en/guides/cli)\n"
msgstr ""
"Instala la [CLI de Hugging "
"Face](https://huggingface.co/docs/huggingface_hub/main/en/guides/cli)\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Log in to your Hugging Face account\n"
msgstr "Inicia sesión en tu cuenta de Hugging Face\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    ```\n"
"    huggingface-cli login\n"
"    ```\n"
msgstr ""
"    ```\n"
"    huggingface-cli login\n"
"    ```\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Download the model you prefer from the previous list\n"
msgstr "Descarga el modelo que prefieras de la lista anterior\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    ```\n"
"    huggingface-cli download <HF REPO NAME> <MODEL PATH> --local-dir <LOCAL PATH>\n"
"    ```\n"
msgstr ""
"    ```\n"
"    huggingface-cli download <HF REPO NAME> <MODEL PATH> --local-dir <LOCAL PATH>\n"
"    ```\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<AccordionItem title=\"Manually deploy the Qiskit Code Assistant models in "
"local through Ollama\">\n"
msgstr ""
"<AccordionItem title=\"Desplegar manualmente los modelos de Qiskit Code "
"Assistant en local mediante Ollama\">\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"There are multiple ways to deploy and interact with the downloaded Qiskit "
"Code Assistant model. This guide demonstrates using "
"[Ollama](https://ollama.com) as follows: either with the [Ollama "
"application](#using-the-ollama-application) by using the Hugging Face Hub "
"integration or local model, or with the [`llama-cpp-python` package](#use-"
"llama-cpp-python).\n"
msgstr ""
"Hay múltiples formas de desplegar e interactuar con el modelo de Qiskit Code"
" Assistant descargado. Esta guía muestra cómo hacerlo con "
"[Ollama](https://ollama.com): bien con la [aplicación Ollama](#using-the-"
"ollama-application) usando la integración con Hugging Face Hub o un modelo "
"local, o bien con el [paquete `llama-cpp-python`](#use-llama-cpp-python).\n"

#. type: Title ####
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Using the Ollama application {#using-the-ollama-application}"
msgstr "Usar la aplicación Ollama {#using-the-ollama-application}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The Ollama application provides a simple solution to run the LLMs locally. "
"It is easy to use, with a CLI that makes the whole setup process, model "
"management, and interaction fairly straightforward. It’s ideal for quick "
"experimentation and for users that want fewer technical details to handle.\n"
msgstr ""
"La aplicación Ollama ofrece una solución sencilla para ejecutar los LLMs "
"localmente. Es fácil de usar, con una CLI que simplifica todo el proceso de "
"configuración, gestión de modelos e interacción. Es ideal para "
"experimentación rápida y para usuarios que quieren manejar menos detalles "
"técnicos.\n"

#. type: Title #####
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Install Ollama {#install-ollama}"
msgstr "Instalar Ollama {#install-ollama}"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Download the [Ollama application](https://ollama.com/download)\n"
msgstr "Descarga la [aplicación Ollama](https://ollama.com/download)\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Install the downloaded file\n"
msgstr "Instala el archivo descargado\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Launch the installed Ollama application\n"
msgstr "Lanza la aplicación Ollama instalada\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    <Admonition type=\"info\">\n"
"        The application is running successfully when the Ollama icon appears in the desktop menu bar. You can also verify the service is running by going to `http://localhost:11434/`.\n"
"    </Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"    <Admonition type=\"info\">\n"
"        La aplicación funciona correctamente cuando el icono de Ollama aparece en la barra de menú del escritorio. También puedes verificar que el servicio está en ejecución accediendo a `http://localhost:11434/`.\n"
"    </Admonition>\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Try Ollama in your terminal and start running models. For example:\n"
msgstr ""
"Prueba Ollama en tu terminal y comienza a ejecutar modelos. Por ejemplo:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    ```\n"
"    ollama run hf.co/Qiskit/Qwen2.5-Coder-14B-Qiskit\n"
"    ```\n"
msgstr ""
"    ```\n"
"    ollama run hf.co/Qiskit/Qwen2.5-Coder-14B-Qiskit\n"
"    ```\n"

#. type: Title #####
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Set up Ollama using the Hugging Face Hub integration {#set-up-ollama-using-"
"the-hugging-face-hub-integration}"
msgstr ""
"Configurar Ollama usando la integración con Hugging Face Hub {#set-up-"
"ollama-using-the-hugging-face-hub-integration}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"The [Ollama/Hugging Face Hub "
"integration](https://huggingface.co/docs/hub/ollama) provides a way to "
"interact with models hosted on the Hugging Face Hub without needing to "
"create a new modelfile nor manually downloading the GGUF or safetensors "
"files. The default `template` and `params` files are already included for "
"the model on the Hugging Face Hub.\n"
msgstr ""
"La [integración Ollama/Hugging Face "
"Hub](https://huggingface.co/docs/hub/ollama) proporciona una forma de "
"interactuar con modelos alojados en Hugging Face Hub sin necesidad de crear "
"un nuevo modelfile ni descargar manualmente los archivos GGUF o safetensors."
" Los archivos `template` y `params` predeterminados ya están incluidos para "
"el modelo en Hugging Face Hub.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Make sure the Ollama application is running.\n"
msgstr "Asegúrate de que la aplicación Ollama esté en ejecución.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Go the desired model page, and copy the URL. For example, "
"https://huggingface.co/Qiskit/Qwen2.5-Coder-14B-Qiskit-GGUF.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ve a la página del modelo deseado y copia la URL. Por ejemplo, "
"https://huggingface.co/Qiskit/Qwen2.5-Coder-14B-Qiskit-GGUF.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "From your terminal, run the command:\n"
msgstr "Desde tu terminal, ejecuta el comando:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"You can use the `hf.co/Qiskit/Qwen2.5-Coder-14B-Qiskit` model or any of the "
"other currently recommended GGUF official models `hf.co/Qiskit/mistral-"
"small-3.2-24b-qiskit-GGUF` or `hf.co/Qiskit/granite-3.3-8b-qiskit-GGUF`.\n"
msgstr ""
"Puedes usar el modelo `hf.co/Qiskit/Qwen2.5-Coder-14B-Qiskit` o cualquiera "
"de los otros modelos GGUF oficiales actualmente recomendados: "
"`hf.co/Qiskit/mistral-small-3.2-24b-qiskit-GGUF` o "
"`hf.co/Qiskit/granite-3.3-8b-qiskit-GGUF`.\n"

#. type: Title #####
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Set up Ollama with a manually downloaded Qiskit Code Assistant GGUF model "
"{#set-up-ollama-with-a-manually-downloaded-qiskit-code-assistant-gguf-model}"
msgstr ""
"Configurar Ollama con un modelo GGUF de Qiskit Code Assistant descargado "
"manualmente {#set-up-ollama-with-a-manually-downloaded-qiskit-code-"
"assistant-gguf-model}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"If you have manually downloaded a GGUF model such as "
"https://huggingface.co/Qiskit/Qwen2.5-Coder-14B-Qiskit-GGUF and you want to "
"experiment with different templates and parameters, you can follow these "
"steps to load it into your local Ollama application.\n"
msgstr ""
"Si has descargado manualmente un modelo GGUF como "
"https://huggingface.co/Qiskit/Qwen2.5-Coder-14B-Qiskit-GGUF y quieres "
"experimentar con diferentes plantillas y parámetros, puedes seguir estos "
"pasos para cargarlo en tu aplicación Ollama local.\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Create a `Modelfile` entering the following content and be sure to update "
"`<PATH-TO-GGUF-FILE>` to the actual path of your downloaded model.\n"
msgstr ""
"Crea un `Modelfile` con el siguiente contenido y asegúrate de actualizar "
"`<PATH-TO-GGUF-FILE>` con la ruta real de tu modelo descargado.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    ```\n"
"    FROM <PATH-TO-GGUF-FILE>\n"
"    TEMPLATE \"\"\"{{ if .System }}\n"
"    System:\n"
"    {{ .System }}\n"
msgstr ""
"    ```\n"
"    FROM <PATH-TO-GGUF-FILE>\n"
"    TEMPLATE \"\"\"{{ if .System }}\n"
"    System:\n"
"    {{ .System }}\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    {{ end }}{{ if .Prompt }}Question:\n"
"    {{ .Prompt }}\n"
msgstr ""
"    {{ end }}{{ if .Prompt }}Question:\n"
"    {{ .Prompt }}\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    {{ end }}Answer:\n"
"    ```\n"
"    \"\"\"\n"
msgstr ""
"    {{ end }}Answer:\n"
"    ```\n"
"    \"\"\"\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    PARAMETER stop \"Question:\"\n"
"    PARAMETER stop \"Answer:\"\n"
"    PARAMETER stop \"System:\"\n"
"    PARAMETER stop \"```\"\n"
msgstr ""
"    PARAMETER stop \"Question:\"\n"
"    PARAMETER stop \"Answer:\"\n"
"    PARAMETER stop \"System:\"\n"
"    PARAMETER stop \"```\"\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    PARAMETER temperature 0\n"
"    PARAMETER top_k 1\n"
msgstr ""
"    PARAMETER temperature 0\n"
"    PARAMETER top_k 1\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "    ```\n"
msgstr "    ```\n"

#. type: Bullet: '1. '
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Run the following command to create a custom model instance based on the "
"`Modelfile`.\n"
msgstr ""
"Ejecuta el siguiente comando para crear una instancia de modelo "
"personalizada basada en el `Modelfile`.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    ```\n"
"    ollama create Qwen2.5-Coder-14B-Qiskit -f ./path-to-model-file\n"
msgstr ""
"    ```\n"
"    ollama create Qwen2.5-Coder-14B-Qiskit -f ./path-to-model-file\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"    <Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"        This process may take some time for Ollama to read the model file, initialize the model instance, and configure it according to the specifications provided.\n"
"    </Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"    <Admonition type=\"note\">\n"
"        Este proceso puede tardar algún tiempo mientras Ollama lee el archivo del modelo, inicializa la instancia del modelo y lo configura según las especificaciones proporcionadas.\n"
"    </Admonition>\n"

#. type: Title #####
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Run the Qiskit Code Assistant model manually downloaded in Ollama"
msgstr ""
"Ejecutar el modelo de Qiskit Code Assistant descargado manualmente en Ollama"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"After the `Qwen2.5-Coder-14B-Qiskit` model has been set up in Ollama, run "
"the following command to launch the model and interact with it in the "
"terminal (in chat mode).\n"
msgstr ""
"Una vez que el modelo `Qwen2.5-Coder-14B-Qiskit` esté configurado en Ollama,"
" ejecuta el siguiente comando para lanzarlo e interactuar con él en la "
"terminal (en modo chat).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "from llama_cpp import Llama\n"
msgstr "from llama_cpp import Llama\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "model_path = <PATH-TO-GGUF-FILE>\n"
msgstr "model_path = <PATH-TO-GGUF-FILE>\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"model = Llama(\n"
"        model_path,\n"
"        seed=17,\n"
"        n_ctx=10000,\n"
"        n_gpu_layers=37, # to offload in gpu, but put 0 if all in cpu\n"
"    )\n"
msgstr ""
"model = Llama(\n"
"        model_path,\n"
"        seed=17,\n"
"        n_ctx=10000,\n"
"        n_gpu_layers=37, # to offload in gpu, but put 0 if all in cpu\n"
"    )\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"input = 'Generate a quantum circuit with 2 qubits'\n"
"raw_pred = model(input)[\"choices\"][0][\"text\"]\n"
msgstr ""
"input = 'Generate a quantum circuit with 2 qubits'\n"
"raw_pred = model(input)[“choices”][0][“text”]\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"generation_kwargs = {\n"
"        \"max_tokens\": 512,\n"
"        \"echo\": False, # Echo the prompt in the output\n"
"        \"top_k\": 1\n"
"    }\n"
msgstr ""
"generation_kwargs = {\n"
"        “max_tokens”: 512,\n"
"        “echo”: False, # Echo the prompt in the output\n"
"        “top_k”: 1\n"
"    }\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "raw_pred = model(input, **generation_kwargs)[\"choices\"][0][\"text\"]\n"
msgstr "raw_pred = model(input, **generation_kwargs)[“choices”][0][“text”]\n"

#. type: Title #
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Use a local model file {#use-a-local-model-file}"
msgstr "Use a local model file {#use-a-local-model-file}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "llama-cli -m my_model.gguf -cnv\n"
msgstr "llama-cli -m my_model.gguf -cnv\n"

#. type: Title #
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Or download and run a model directly from Hugging Face {#or-download-and-"
"run-a-model-directly-from-hugging-face}"
msgstr ""
"Or download and run a model directly from Hugging Face {#or-download-and-"
"run-a-model-directly-from-hugging-face}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "llama-cli -hf Qiskit/Qwen2.5-Coder-14B-Qiskit-GGUF -cnv\n"
msgstr "llama-cli -hf Qiskit/Qwen2.5-Coder-14B-Qiskit-GGUF -cnv\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "llama-server -hf Qiskit/Qwen2.5-Coder-14B-Qiskit-GGUF\n"
msgstr "llama-server -hf Qiskit/Qwen2.5-Coder-14B-Qiskit-GGUF\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"llama-cli -hf Qiskit/Qwen2.5-Coder-14B-Qiskit-GGUF \\\n"
"  -p \"You are a friendly assistant.\" -cnv \\\n"
"  --temp 0.7 \\\n"
"  --top-k 50 \\\n"
"  --top-p 0.95 \\\n"
"  --repeat-penalty 1.1 \\\n"
"  --seed 42\n"
msgstr ""
"llama-cli -hf Qiskit/Qwen2.5-Coder-14B-Qiskit-GGUF \\\n"
"  -p “You are a friendly assistant.” -cnv \\\n"
"  --temp 0.7 \\\n"
"  --top-k 50 \\\n"
"  --top-p 0.95 \\\n"
"  --repeat-penalty 1.1 \\\n"
"  --seed 42\n"

